---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Experience \u2014 Shailly | Operations, Program Management & Content" description="Full experience: Academic Counselor at Vedantu; Program Operations Coordinator, Head of Content, and Social Media Manager at The Period Society Rajasthan; content, copywriting, and business development roles; education." path="/experience/">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumb mono" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Experience</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="page-head-grid">
        <div>
          <h1>Work that involved <em>moving parts.</em></h1>
          <div class="page-lede">
            <p>A progression from content, research, and educational work into program operations, recruitment, onboarding, and organisational systems.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="head-fact reveal">
          <span class="mono">Overview</span>
          <dl>
            <dt class="mono">Current</dt>
            <dd>Academic Counselor &middot; Vedantu &middot; Aug 2026 &mdash; Present</dd>
            <dt class="mono">Longest</dt>
            <dd>Program Operations Coordinator &amp; Organisational Mentor &middot; The Period Society Rajasthan &middot; Feb 2021 &mdash; Oct 2024</dd>
            <dt class="mono">Also</dt>
            <dd>Head of Content &middot; Social Media Manager &middot; content and copywriting roles &middot; one-week fundraising internship</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="wrap">

      <!-- VEDANTU -->
      <article class="role-block reveal">
        <header class="role-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Vedantu</h2>
            <p class="role-sub">Academic Counselor</p>
          </div>
          <p class="role-when mono"><strong>Aug 2026 &mdash; Present</strong><span class="now">Current</span></p>
        </header>
        <div class="role-body">
          <div class="prose">
            <p class="lead">Working across the student and parent interaction lifecycle, from initial enquiry through demos and enrollment.</p>
            <p>My role involves maintaining structured lead records, managing follow-ups, coordinating internal handoffs, and monitoring progress in a high-volume EdTech environment.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="resp-title mono">Responsibilities</p>
            <ul class="resp">
              <li>Counsel parents and prospective students to understand learning needs and goals, recommending suitable programs and explaining course offerings.</li>
              <li>Conduct inbound and outbound calls, including WhatsApp outreach, to engage prospective parents and qualify leads.</li>
              <li>Conduct pre- and post-demo calls to assess enrollment potential, build rapport, address concerns, and support lead conversion through consultative selling and follow-ups.</li>
              <li>Maintain detailed lead records, interaction history, and follow-up activities using LeadSquared, MCUBE, and Google Workspace.</li>
              <li>Coordinate with Master Teachers, Demo, and Onboarding teams to guide parents through the end-to-end enrollment journey.</li>
              <li>Track daily performance against individual targets and monitor lead statuses in a high-volume environment.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- TPSR -->
      <article class="role-block role-block--org reveal">
        <header class="role-head">
          <div>
            <h2>The Period Society Rajasthan</h2>
            <p class="role-sub">Program Operations Coordinator &amp; Organisational Mentor &middot; Head of Content &middot; Social Media Manager</p>
          </div>
          <p class="role-when mono"><strong>Feb 2021 &mdash; Oct 2024</strong></p>
        </header>
        <div class="role-body">
          <div class="prose">
            <p class="lead">The Period Society Rajasthan was a volunteer-led organisation working on menstrual health education and awareness, with more than 50 volunteers.</p>
            <p>My responsibilities evolved over time across content, social media, program operations, organisational systems, recruitment, onboarding, and educational initiatives.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="role-track">
            <div class="rt-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <section class="rt-role">
              <header class="rt-head">
                <span class="rt-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <h3>Program Operations Coordinator &amp; Organisational Mentor</h3>
                <span class="rt-when mono">Feb 2021 &mdash; Oct 2024</span>
              </header>
              <ul class="resp">
                <li>Designed and optimised recruitment, interview, and onboarding systems for a 50+ volunteer chapter, reducing applicant communication timelines from several weeks to under 7 days.</li>
                <li>Built and maintained organisational knowledge systems, including policies, code of conduct frameworks, onboarding resources, volunteer agreements, MOAs, and curriculum documentation.</li>
                <li>Managed resource constraints across concurrent initiatives by reallocating responsibilities, simplifying workflows, adjusting timelines, and stepping into execution work when teams were understaffed.</li>
                <li>Created and maintained project trackers for multiple initiatives, tracking tasks, timelines, and progress.</li>
                <li>Coordinated follow-ups, scheduling, meeting logistics, and action items, providing status updates to leadership and department heads.</li>
                <li>Managed operational coordination across departments, including attendance tracking, leave management, and external stakeholder communication.</li>
                <li>Supported organisational continuity across content, communications, social media, design, and events during volunteer shortages and staffing transitions.</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="rt-role">
              <header class="rt-head">
                <span class="rt-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <h3>Head of Content</h3>
                <span class="rt-when mono">Concurrent role</span>
              </header>
              <div class="prose">
                <p>Led the content vertical, overseeing educational content workflows, publishing pipelines, and learning resources for the organisation.</p>
              </div>
              <ul class="resp">
                <li>Led educational content workflows, publishing pipelines, and learning resources supporting 30+ educational initiatives.</li>
                <li>Managed a 20+ member content team across writing, research, proofreading, editing, and educational scripting through structured feedback and review cycles.</li>
                <li>Served as the primary reviewer and approval authority for educational content before publication.</li>
                <li>Developed the organisation&rsquo;s first reusable educational curriculum framework, standardising age-appropriate content structures, learning objectives, and session flows for school outreach.</li>
                <li>Coordinated cross-functional publishing workflows with design, outreach, and social media teams.</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="rt-role">
              <header class="rt-head">
                <span class="rt-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <h3>Social Media Manager</h3>
                <span class="rt-when mono">Concurrent role</span>
              </header>
              <div class="prose">
                <p>Managed Instagram operations for the Rajasthan chapter, supporting the organisation&rsquo;s communication and audience engagement.</p>
              </div>
              <ul class="resp">
                <li>Managed Instagram operations, including publishing workflows, educational campaigns, recruitment communications, and audience engagement initiatives.</li>
                <li>Coordinated content calendars, promotional timelines, and stakeholder communication with content, outreach, and design teams.</li>
                <li>Maintained continuity of social media operations during staffing transitions, recruitment cycles, and departmental handovers.</li>
              </ul>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- EARLIER -->
      <article class="role-block role-block--earlier reveal">
        <header class="role-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Earlier roles</h2>
            <p class="role-sub">Content, copywriting, and business development</p>
          </div>
        </header>
        <div class="role-body">
          <div>
          <p class="resp-title mono">Experience</p>
          <ul class="role-list">
            <li>
              <div class="rl-head"><h3>Freelance Copywriter</h3><span class="mono rl-when">Freelance &middot; Mar 2022 &mdash; Jun 2023</span></div>
              <p>Repurposed long-form podcast conversations into blog-style articles for an American audience, transcribing and structuring content while preserving tone, pacing, and speaker intent. Independently determined article direction, structure, and tone, and wrote audience-aligned copy for blogs, social posts, and episode descriptions, often under 24-hour deadlines.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="rl-head"><h3>Content Writer</h3><span class="mono rl-when">Broxer &middot; Jun &mdash; Sep 2022</span></div>
              <p>Managed high-volume content workflows, delivering more than five daily news and infotainment scripts. Translated English news content into Hindi, wrote conversational YouTube scripts, and cross-verified information across multiple sources for factual accuracy.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="rl-head"><h3>Content Writer</h3><span class="mono rl-when">Affnosys India &middot; Dec 2021 &mdash; Jan 2022</span></div>
              <p>Wrote SEO-focused and audience-oriented content across multiple topics and formats. Conducted topic research, structured articles, and edited drafts for clarity, readability, and engagement under deadline-driven workflows.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="rl-head"><h3>Business Development (Fundraising &amp; Strategies Development) Intern</h3><span class="mono rl-when">JMES &middot; May 7&ndash;14, 2022</span></div>
              <p>Completed a one-week internship involving fundraising and strategy development. Contributed to fundraising activities for the SHIKSHA project, strategy development, and interdepartmental coordination.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- EDUCATION -->
      <article class="role-block role-block--edu reveal">
        <header class="role-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Education</h2>
            <p class="role-sub">Formal qualifications</p>
          </div>
        </header>
        <div class="role-body">
          <div class="edu-table" role="table" aria-label="Education history">
            <div class="edu-row" role="row">
              <span class="qual" role="cell">Bachelor of Arts</span>
              <span class="inst" role="cell">Panjab University, Chandigarh</span>
              <span class="yr mono" role="cell">2023 &mdash; 2026</span>
              <span class="score mono" role="cell">57%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="edu-row" role="row">
              <span class="qual" role="cell">Bachelor of Arts in English, Political Science &amp; History</span>
              <span class="inst" role="cell">CHRIST University, Bengaluru</span>
              <span class="yr mono" role="cell">2021 &mdash; 2023</span>
              <span class="score mono" role="cell">3.3/4.0</span>
            </div>
            <div class="edu-row" role="row">
              <span class="qual" role="cell">Class XII &mdash; CBSE</span>
              <span class="inst" role="cell">Welham Girls&rsquo; School, Dehradun</span>
              <span class="yr mono" role="cell">2021</span>
              <span class="score mono" role="cell">95.5%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="edu-row" role="row">
              <span class="qual" role="cell">Class X &mdash; CBSE</span>
              <span class="inst" role="cell">Delhi Public School, Jodhpur</span>
              <span class="yr mono" role="cell">2019</span>
              <span class="score mono" role="cell">90.8%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="reveal" style="margin-top:2.5rem">
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/work/">See how this work translated into projects <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
